      374.89,
      539.87,
      397.96
    ],
    "text": "REGULATIONS made by the Minister of Finance and Mass Media under section 112 of the Regulation of Insurance IndustryAct, No. 43 of 2000 read with section 16 of the aforesaid Act.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
